# Input graph for DataDrivenCPS__acquirium__src_acquirium_Storage_graph_store.py___graph_affects_closure — written during translation.
# This one covers the FALSE branch: neither owl:imports nor rdf:type
# owl:Ontology anywhere in the graph, plus neighbouring triples that must
# NOT match (a plain rdf:type on a non-owl:Ontology class, a predicate that
# is not owl:imports). The two TRUE branches (owl:imports present /
# rdf:type owl:Ontology present) are built inline in driver.py, since the
# region reads the WHOLE graph rather than a filtered pattern -- a single
# fixture file cannot hold three separate "whole graph" scenarios.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:a rdf:type ex:PlainClass .
ex:b ex:seeAlso ex:c .
